:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Dealer []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<set _casino to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino>>
<<if _casino.available>>
	<<npc 'Marlow'>><<person1>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			Marlow finishes paying a winner before turning to you. "Looking for work? Keep the bets visible, deal cleanly, and call me before a disagreement turns into a fight. Nobody needs a clever dealer who can't count the chips."
		<<option 'CN'>>
			马洛先把奖金付给赢下牌局的人，才转向你。“找工作？把下注摆在明处，发牌别出差错。争论闹成动手以前先叫我。大家需要的是点得清筹码的荷官。”
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<if !_casino.state.trained>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				"I can show you the job for an hour. <span class='gold'>£10</span> for the training shift. After that, the base pay is <span class='gold'>£30</span> an hour, plus <span class='gold'>£10</span> if you handle the table correctly." Marlow sets an unused deck beside an empty place.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				“我可以带你做一小时。这一小时给你 <span class='gold'>£10</span>。之后每小时底薪 <span class='gold'>£30</span>，照看牌桌没有出错，再加 <span class='gold'>£10</span>。”马洛把一副没用过的牌放在空位旁。
		<</language>><br><br>
		<<if _casino.canWork>>
			<<icon 'dealer.png'>><<lanLink ['Take the training shift (1:00)', '跟马洛学做荷官 (1:00)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Training'>>
				<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.canWork and !$LifeSimulation.casino.trained>>
					<<set $LifeSimulation.casino.trained to true>><<money 1000>><<tiredness 4>><<stress 2>><<pass 60>>
				<</if>>
			<</lanLink>><br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				"<span class='gold'>£30</span> an hour. Another <span class='gold'>£10</span> for a table kept in order. Miscounts come out of the bonus, not your pocket." Marlow points to the places waiting to be filled. "Finish any hand you're playing before you clock in."
			<<option 'CN'>>
				“每小时 <span class='gold'>£30</span>。牌桌照看得妥当，再加 <span class='gold'>£10</span>。点错筹码扣奖金，不让你倒贴。”马洛指了指空着的位置。“先结束你自己正在玩的牌局，再来接班。”
		<</language>><br><br>
		<<if _casino.canWork>>
			<<icon 'dealer.png'>><<lanLink ['Take a shift (1:00)', '接一个班次 (1:00)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work'>>
				<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.work_scenario is null>><<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.beginWork()>><</if>>
			<</lanLink>><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if !_casino.canWork>>
		<span class='blue'><<language>>
			<<option 'EN'>>
				You cannot start an hour-long shift now. You need to be free of a live hand, able to use your hands and speak, and rested enough to work. New shifts stop at 03:00.
			<<option 'CN'>>
				你现在无法接一小时班次。需要先结束正在玩的牌局，双手和说话不受束缚，并保持足够清醒。03:00 起不再安排新班次。
		<</language>></span><br>
	<</if>>
<<else>><span class='blue'><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Marlow is not taking on staff now.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		马洛现在不安排帮工。
<</language>></span><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Training []
<<nobr>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'deadwood_casino'>><<effects>>
<<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Marlow has you practise with an unused deck before letting you deal a quiet table. Your fingers catch the edge of a card; Marlow stops your hand and shows you the motion again. You learn to keep folded cards apart, count bets aloud, and leave a full view of the chips.<br><br>
		At the end of the hour, <span class='gold'>£10</span> is counted into your hand. "You can take a regular shift next time. If you're uncertain, ask before you pay the pot."
	<<option 'CN'>>
		马洛先让你用闲置的牌练习，才让你接手一张不太忙的牌桌。你的手指勾住牌角，马洛按住你的手，又示范了一次。你学着把弃牌放在一旁，报出注额，让桌上的筹码保持清楚可见。<br><br>
		一小时结束后，<span class='gold'>£10</span> 被点到你手里。“下次就可以来上班了。不确定的话，发奖金以前先问。”
<</language>><br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<set _casino to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino>>
<<if _casino.canWork and _casino.state.work_scenario isnot null>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			You take the dealer's place. For most of the shift, the work is counting, shuffling and moving cards across the cloth. Marlow watches from the next table, stepping in when the room grows louder. Then a player questions a ruling and everyone waits for you.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你站到荷官的位置上。大半时间，你都在点筹码、洗牌，把牌沿着绿毡推过去。马洛从隔壁牌桌留意着你，赌馆嘈杂起来时就走近些。随后有客人对一项判定提出异议，所有人都等着你答复。
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<switch _casino.state.work_scenario>>
		<<case 0>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>
					One player has £20 in front of them. The next raises the total to £60. The first points at their chips. "How much more do I owe?"
				<<option 'CN'>>
					一个客人已在面前放了 £20。下一位把总注额加到 £60。前者指着自己的筹码。“我还要补多少？”
			<</language>><br><br>
			<<lanLink ['£40', '£40'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End'>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 0>><</lanLink>><br>
			<<lanLink ['£60', '£60'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End'>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 1>><</lanLink>><br>
		<<case 1>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>
					One player is all-in for £50. Two others have put in £100 each. The short stack wins the best hand and reaches for all £250.
				<<option 'CN'>>
					一位客人以 £50 全下，另外两人各投入 £100。短筹码的客人拿着最强手牌，伸手要取走全部 £250。
			<</language>><br><br>
			<<lanLink ['Pay all £250 to the best hand', '把 £250 全付给最强手牌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End'>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 0>><</lanLink>><br>
			<<lanLink ['Award the £150 main pot; settle the £100 side pot separately', '先判定 £150 主池，另外结算 £100 边池'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End'>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 1>><</lanLink>><br>
		<<case 2>>
			<<language>>
				<<option 'EN'>>
					The five community cards form a royal flush. Neither player's private cards improve it. One insists that their pair of queens should win.
				<<option 'CN'>>
					五张公共牌已经组成皇家同花顺，两人的底牌都无法让它更强。其中一人坚称自己的一对 Q 应当赢。
			<</language>><br><br>
			<<lanLink ['Split the pot', '平分底池'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End'>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 0>><</lanLink>><br>
			<<lanLink ['Award the pot to the pair of queens', '把底池判给一对 Q'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End'>><<deadwood-casino-work-pay 1>><</lanLink>><br>
	<</switch>>
<<else>>
	<span class='blue'><<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			The shift cannot start in your present condition.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你现在的状态无法开始这个班次。
	<</language>></span><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Step away without taking the shift', '不接班，退到一旁'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<set $LifeSimulation.casino.work_scenario to null>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-casino-work-pay'>>
	<<set $_wage to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.finishWork(_args[0])>>
	<<if $_wage gt 0>>
		<<money $_wage>><<tiredness 4>>
		<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.last_work_correct>>
			<<stress 2>><<set C.npc.Marlow.love to Math.clamp(C.npc.Marlow.love + 1, 0, 30)>>
		<<else>><<stress 6>><</if>>
		<<pass 60>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Work End []
<<nobr>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'deadwood_casino'>><<effects>>
<<if $LifeSimulation.casino.last_work_correct is true>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			You explain the ruling and count the chips where everyone can see. The objection quiets down. Marlow checks the payout, then leaves you to finish the table. At the end of the hour, you receive <span class='gold'>£40</span>.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			你说明判定，把筹码点在所有人都看得见的地方。异议渐渐平息。马洛核对过金额，便让你继续照看牌桌。一小时结束，你领到 <span class='gold'>£40</span>。
	<</language>><br><br>
<<elseif $LifeSimulation.casino.last_work_correct is false>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			Marlow puts a hand on the rack before any chips leave it. "Wait. Count it again." The ruling is corrected in front of the players. You finish the hour under closer supervision and receive your base pay of <span class='gold'>£30</span>.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			筹码还没离开托盘，马洛就按住了它。“等等。再数一遍。”判定当着客人的面纠正过来。你在更严密的看顾下做完这一小时，领到底薪 <span class='gold'>£30</span>。
	<</language>><br><br>
<<else>><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		No shift has been completed.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		你还没有完成班次。
<</language>><br><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Wren []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.wrenPresent>>
	<<npc 'Wren'>><<person1>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			<<if $wrenSeen?.includes('cards')>>
				"Found another card table, have you?" Wren asks, a grin spreading across the familiar face.
			<<elseif $wrenSeen?.length>>
				"Fancy meeting you somewhere with chairs," Wren says, recognising you.
			<<else>>
				"New face." Wren looks you over once, a grin spreading.
			<</if>>
			&#32;A chip is turned between two fingers. "Go on, sit down. Or watch. You might learn something." Wren glances towards Marlow as the deck is shuffled, then returns attention to the bets.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			<<if $wrenSeen?.includes('cards')>>
				“又找到一张牌桌，是吧？”伦恩问，熟悉的脸上扬起笑容。
			<<elseif $wrenSeen?.length>>
				“没想到在有椅子的地方也能碰上你。”伦恩认出你，开口道。
			<<else>>
				“生面孔。”伦恩上下看了你一眼，扬起笑容。
			<</if>>
			&#32;一枚筹码在两指间翻动。“来，坐下。看着也行，说不定能学点什么。”洗牌声响起时，伦恩朝马洛看了一眼，随后又把注意力放回下注上。
	<</language>><br><br>
	<<icon 'poker-chips.png'>><<lanLink ["Join the hold'em table", '加入德州扑克'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Holdem'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Wren has already left. Another guest takes the empty seat.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		伦恩已经离开，另一个客人坐上了空位。
<</language>><br><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Landry []
<<nobr>>
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.landryPresent>>
	<<npc 'Landry'>><<person1>>
	<<language>>
		<<option 'EN'>>
			Landry acknowledges you with a small nod. The person opposite rises and disappears down the stairs. "Just meeting someone," Landry says, turning the untouched glass by its rim. "If you need to discuss work, find me at the pub. Too many ears here." The conversation ends as another guest approaches.
		<<option 'CN'>>
			兰德里轻轻点头，算是向你打招呼。对面的人起身，沿着楼梯离开。“只是见个人。”兰德里捏着杯沿，转了转没动过的杯子。“找我谈工作的话，去酒馆。这里耳朵太多。”另一个客人走近，交谈也就到此为止。
	<</language>><br><br>
<<else>><<language>>
	<<option 'EN'>>
		Landry has gone. The glass has been cleared away.
	<<option 'CN'>>
		兰德里已经走了，杯子也被收走。
<</language>><br><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
<</nobr>>
